      "text": "**Creating a playlist**\n\nI need to create a playlist with a duration of 45-50 minutes using the provided songs. First, I'll check the durations of the songs in the list. It makes sense to look at all the visible song durations and choose a subset that fits. The best workflow might be going to Playlists, then creating a new one, naming it, and after that, adding songs with their duration info. I just need to understand the app better!\n\n",
