      "text": "**Optimizing playlist management**\n\nI'm thinking about how to streamline the \"Add to playlist\" feature for songs. Right now, there are too many actions involved, and a multi-select option would be ideal. Maybe a long press on the title could start a selection mode, then I could click additional songs. It looks like I might aim for around 12 selections at once, considering the current interactions. I wonder if I could optimize by adding entire albums instead. Long pressing the first song could be the first step!\n\n",
